<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/eng@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of an urban revitalization project, the local authority may serve a notice of intention for initiation of urban revitalization project to any interested person as the local authority thinks expedient to carry out an urban revitalization project."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/eng@> .
