<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/eng@/~part_III__cl_23__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon consultation referred to in subsection (2) is concluded, the interested person may consent or refuse to consent with the initiation of urban revitalization project."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/25/eng@> .
